      s5t: "QRGoBox opens the barrier: in progress",
      s5d: "QRGoBox, wired to the gate's own electronics, will open the barrier automatically, and by hand from logistiq.cloud. The QRGoBox hardware and software versions are in beta and are currently being tested.",
