      a1: "You create departments (e.g. Cold Storage, Fresh Produce, Dry Goods), each with its own ramps, plus a list of cargo categories and truck types. A driver picks the cargo category and truck type on check-in, and your routing rules map each category to the department that handles it.",
      q2: "Can one ramp serve more than one department?",
